('74', 'Galeri Arkeologi Guar Kepah', 'Penang', 'Radiocarbon dating carried out in the United States showed that the remains of the ‘Penang Woman’ discovered in Guar Kepah was approximately 5,710 years old. Although her legs were partially destroyed due to digging works, her arms were folded and she was', 'Galeri Arkeologi Guar Kepah, Jalan Guar Kepah, 08600 Bumbung Lima, Penang, Malaysia', NULL, '2026-08-11 22:35:34', '2026-08-11 22:35:34'),
