('154', 'Tawau Japanese War Memorial', 'Sabah', 'Tawau Japanese War Memorial (Japanese: タワウ戦争記念館; Malay: Tugu Peringatan Perang Jepun Tawau) is a former Japanese cemetery in Tawau in the Malaysian state of Sabah which now has been transformed into a memorial.', 'Tawau Japanese War Memorial, Jalan Kukusan, 91007 Tawau, Sabah, Malaysia', 'https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/10/Tawau_Sabah_JapaneseCemetery-01.jpg/400px-Tawau_Sabah_JapaneseCemetery-01.jpg', '2026-08-11 22:55:01', '2026-08-12 00:06:22'),
